{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用动态规划记录每个前缀能否由字典单词拼成：dp[i] 表示 s 的前 i 个字符是否可拆分。动画展示示例 3 中 cat、cats、sand、and 如何形成可达前缀，以及 dog 虽在字典中，却因它前面的前缀不可达而无法完成拼接。最终 dp[9] 为 false，因此 catsandog 不能被完整拆分。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>单词拆分动态规划演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.tag{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.string-grid,.dp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,minmax(38px,1fr));gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.char-cell,.dp-cell{padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center;font-size:11px}\n.char{font-size:13px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#fff}\n.dp-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dp-value{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.char-cell.active,.dp-cell.focus{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.dp-cell.reachable{border-color:#3794ff}\n.dp-cell.reachable .dp-value{color:#3794ff}\n.explain{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.explain{grid-template-columns:1fr}.string-grid,.dp-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}}\n.step-no{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600;font-size:12px}\n.word{display:inline-block;margin:4px 0;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.formula{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.result{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}\n.result.done{background:#3a2424;border-color:#d16969}\n.legend{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:4px}\n.dot{width:8px;height:8px;display:inline-block;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:2px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:4px}\n.dot.blue{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.dot.outline{border-color:#3794ff}\n\n.dp-cell.focus .dp-value{color:#fff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>单词拆分：前缀可达</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 3 · <span class=\"mono\">catsandog</span></p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"tag\">s = catsandog</span><span class=\"tag\">dict: cat,cats,sand,and,dog</span></div>\n<div class=\"panel-title\">字符</div><div class=\"string-grid\" id=\"chars\"></div>\n<div class=\"panel-title\">dp</div><div class=\"dp-grid\" id=\"dp\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot blue\"></i>当前子串</span><span><i class=\"dot outline\"></i>可达边界</span></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"explain\">\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"step-no\" id=\"stepNo\">步骤 1 / 7</div><div class=\"word\" id=\"word\">空前缀</div><p class=\"muted\" id=\"status\" style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">转移</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45\">存在 j：dp[j] 且 s[j..i) 在字典中 → dp[i]=true</p><div class=\"formula\">dp[i] = ⋁ dp[j] ∧ dict</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"result\" id=\"result\"><strong>结论：</strong><span id=\"resultText\">从空前缀开始。</span></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n(() => {\n  const s = 'catsandog';\n  const charBox = document.getElementById('chars');\n  const dpBox = document.getElementById('dp');\n  const stepNo = document.getElementById('stepNo');\n  const word = document.getElementById('word');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n  const resultText = document.getElementById('resultText');\n\n  [...s].forEach((ch, i) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'char-cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"char\">${ch}</div><div class=\"index\">区间 ${i}→${i + 1}</div>`;\n    charBox.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  for (let i = 0; i <= s.length; i++) {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'dp-cell';\n    cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"dp-label\">dp[${i}]</div><div class=\"dp-value\">false</div>`;\n    dpBox.appendChild(cell);\n  }\n\n  const steps = [\n    { range: null, focus: 0, reachable: [0], word: '空前缀', text: '初始化 dp[0] = true，表示不取任何字符时已经完成拆分。', result: '可达边界：0。' },\n    { range: [0, 3], focus: 3, reachable: [0, 3], word: 'cat', text: 'dp[0] 为 true，并且 s[0..3) = cat 在字典中，所以点亮 dp[3]。', result: '前缀 cat 可以拆分。' },\n    { range: [0, 4], focus: 4, reachable: [0, 3, 4], word: 'cats', text: 'dp[0] 为 true，并且 s[0..4) = cats 在字典中，所以点亮 dp[4]。', result: '前缀 cats 也可以拆分。' },\n    { range: [3, 7], focus: 7, reachable: [0, 3, 4, 7], word: 'sand', text: '从可达边界 3 出发，s[3..7) = sand 在字典中，因此 dp[7] = true。', result: 'cat + sand 到达边界 7。' },\n    { range: [4, 7], focus: 7, reachable: [0, 3, 4, 7], word: 'and', text: '从可达边界 4 出发也可以：s[4..7) = and，形成另一条到达 dp[7] 的路径。', result: 'cats + and 同样到达边界 7。' },\n    { range: [6, 9], focus: 9, reachable: [0, 3, 4, 7], word: 'dog', text: 'dog 虽然在字典中，但它从边界 6 开始，而 dp[6] = false；左侧 catsan 无法拆分。', result: '仅匹配到单词还不够，它的起点必须可达。' },\n    { range: null, focus: 9, reachable: [0, 3, 4, 7], word: 'dp[9] = false', text: '所有切分位置检查完毕，字符串末尾的边界 9 仍未被点亮。', result: 'catsandog 不能完整拆分，返回 false。', done: true }\n  ];\n\n  let current = 0;\n  function render(stepIndex) {\n    const st = steps[stepIndex];\n    const charCells = [...charBox.children];\n    const dpCells = [...dpBox.children];\n    charCells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      const active = st.range && i >= st.range[0] && i < st.range[1];\n      cell.classList.toggle('active', Boolean(active));\n    });\n    dpCells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      const reachable = st.reachable.includes(i);\n      cell.classList.toggle('reachable', reachable);\n      cell.classList.toggle('focus', i === st.focus);\n      cell.querySelector('.dp-value').textContent = reachable ? 'true' : 'false';\n    });\n    stepNo.textContent = `步骤 ${stepIndex + 1} / ${steps.length}`;\n    word.textContent = st.word;\n    status.textContent = st.text;\n    resultText.textContent = st.result;\n    result.classList.toggle('done', Boolean(st.done));\n  }\n\n  render(current);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(current);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n³ + S)","space_complexity":"O(n + S)","complexity_note":"n 为字符串长度, S 为字典字符总数. 全切分 DP 有 O(n²) 次候选转移; 子串构造与哈希按长度计, 最坏时间为 O(n³ + S). 空间包含 dp、字典和当前子串, 不保存所有候选子串."}
